{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-1531b8d736b1", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:36:07.468Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:36:17.631Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14322, "tokens_out": 331, "latency": 0.333, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the latest adjuster correspondence on TM-2026-0031 and note any actions for me.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:1e71e3db532fd37c80586d49b6d176f6768cd9003544b41878714e4a703505fe", "response_text": "Based on the case file, here's a summary of the latest adjuster correspondence:\n\n**Latest Adjuster Correspondence Summary**\n\nThe most recent adjuster input was the Ashgrove Adjusting report (AA/26/4471) received on **14 May 2026**. This established that the escape of water was caused by a failed push-fit connector installed during a 2023 bathroom refit — a sudden failure rather than gradual deterioration, so the peril is covered.\n\n**Actions Already Completed:**\n- Reserve increased to £21,700 (approved by team leader)\n- Redwell Restoration instructed for drying and reinstatement (19 May)\n- Drying work completed and verified\n- Redwell invoice (RRS-2026-3388) for £18,144.48 authorised and paid (24 June)\n- Subrogation against the 2023 refit contractor considered but closed (contractor dissolved in 2024)\n\n**Current Status:**\nThe claim appears to be in final stages with all substantive work completed. The file shows no outstanding actions as of 24 June 2026. However, given that the claim remains open with a £21,700 reserve and only £18,144 paid, you may wish to clarify whether:\n- Any further recovery work is pending\n- The reserve requires review or closure\n\nWould you like me to note anything specific in the case file, or is there particular correspondence you're expecting?", "response_hash": "sha256:46c7bdfdc9b3588e7348f4369a52187f3b87e616a18140076eb647957d3eb938", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
